  "description": "To Gahee, sex is just a means to fulfill her artistic desires. She uses her camera to capture intimate moments of her sex partners, friends, and other couples. So when she meets Sungha, a cute phys ed major at her school, she wonders what he’d look like through her lens, what faces he’d make in bed. But she quickly learns Sungha is different from the guys she’s used to “dating.” Will he just be another photograph in her collection, or something more? \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
